  "name": "Deadpool — Chaos",
  "description": "Commander, black and red, based on the list \"Deadpool, Commander Deck\" by ReallyBadWizard (Moxfield, bracket 3: three Game Changers, Ancient Tomb, Jeska's Will and Opposition Agent). Deadpool, Trading Card exchanges his text box with another creature's: he takes its abilities, it takes his drawbacks. Token copies (myriad, Orthion, Jaxis, Delina, Saw in Half, The Master, Multiplied, Mirror Box), creatures given to the opponents (Xantcha, Humble Defector, Oft-Nabbed Goat, Alexios) and chaos (Possibility Storm, Share the Spoils, Mob Verdict, Prisoner's Dilemma).",
